  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.1 - README tidy-up, no code change. 1.1.0 - Adds an anonymous daily telemetry heartbeat (random install ID, versions, announcement count bands; never message text; on by default, off in the dashboard Settings tab or with BackofficeAnnouncement:Telemetry:Enabled = false). 1.0.4 - SECURITY FIX, please upgrade. Up to 1.0.3 the announcement API did not require a backoffice login, so anyone could change the announcement and inject script into backoffice users' sessions. 1.0.4 requires a signed-in backoffice user (changing settings needs an admin on Umbraco 15+, Settings-section access on 13/14), validates saved values, and renders the bar without HTML string templates.",
